                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a black eye."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8ffe56b-a7f9-3ed2-924d-940e1f366bf5",
                                        "entry_id": "2f204263-e3d7-3285-beae-a33896b910d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the iris of a black color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b409b1a7-239e-4838-9288-811ebbba2c1f",
                                                "sense_id": "f8ffe56b-a7f9-3ed2-924d-940e1f366bf5",
                                                "text": "This morning Keegan looks blacker-haired and blacker-eyed than ever before. The cold has plucked extra color into his cheeks and nose, and his outsized ears are flower-pot red."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7daec6f7-a0fa-4b46-a022-f52fa5ef169a",
                                                "sense_id": "f8ffe56b-a7f9-3ed2-924d-940e1f366bf5",
                                                "text": "Equally intolerable to her family was her desire, when the time came, to go with the blackest-eyed teenage boy in the tabor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9b26afc-64b4-4e31-87d6-32f4266d5920",
                                                "sense_id": "f8ffe56b-a7f9-3ed2-924d-940e1f366bf5",
                                                "text": "The black pup sits there, listening, watching. Momma looks at him. “If you aren’t the blackest-eyed dog I’ve ever seen,” she says. “We'll start calling you Blacky.[…]”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96790447-ae28-3fc2-a7db-037fd24cf123",
                                        "entry_id": "2f204263-e3d7-3285-beae-a33896b910d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "as a part of a phrase"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "337804f2-334c-44b7-ada1-be68d663afd7",
                                                "sense_id": "96790447-ae28-3fc2-a7db-037fd24cf123",
                                                "text": "black-eyed pea"
